  "otherRetainedFailures": [
    "Initial native test compile failed after removing an import used by a child module; restored before testing.",
    "One native test initially exercised the 128-message writer queue instead of native pending credits; corrected to drain each outgoing command before filling the pending table.",
    "Initial clippy rejected a collapsible if; corrected, final clippy passed.",
    "Final controller used a nonexistent selector-action launcher after twelve successful checks. The failed exit is preserved; the six-check continuation ran the real fixture, trace verifier, packed consumers, remote evaluation, context media and binary path verification."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The still-live blocked focus handler preserves its TimeoutError and uncertain-delivery classification but may require page disposal after bounded cleanup, unlike the reference survivor. Physical child destruction preserves the healthy parent.",
    "Remote snapshots still fail export explicitly. Remote routing/init scripts, unlisted ElementHandle input operations and other unsupported methods retain their separate gates.",
    "Focused geometry covers tested offsets, border/padding, nested local/remote scrolling, explicit positions, parent overlays and translation transforms; it does not claim exhaustive affine geometry coverage.",
    "Earlier thick-border reference failure is retained and not promoted to a supported-success guarantee.",
    "Full current core, native macOS refresh, release packaging/platform matrix and majority-scenario 2x performance remain open.",
    "Raw captures stay private; exported receipts bind their original bytes, while public outcomes and identities are sanitized. Metadata additions after verification are not claimed to belong to the unchanged execution manifest."
  ],
